# Phase 5 input cluster: a catalog that fails at launch (14a12fea's retry
# sentence) and is back later (f4990675 refresh on activity): 503 until the
# `modelsup` line, a point in the scenario rather than a moment on the
# gateway's clock, which each binary's launch reaches at a different time
# (registry #19).
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
models p5-input-models.json
modelsdown
wait 4
type /model
key Enter
wait 2
snap fail-open
key Escape
modelsup
wait 0.5
wait 14
type /model
key Enter
until shown gpt-6-astra
snap after-outage
